#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:1
#: 0d328895412b4d64b60c9f15a2a5e592
msgid "Slacks-Based Efficiency with Undesirable Outputs"
msgstr "含非合意产出的基于松弛变量效率测度"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:3
#: 2a142e5aff974683b06188d09d930437
msgid ""
"A power plant can use too much fuel, generate too little electricity, and "
"emit too much carbon dioxide at the same time. A radial environmental model "
"summarizes a declared joint improvement programme—for example, increase "
"electricity and reduce emissions by the same percentage. That is useful when"
" management has adopted such a programme. It is less informative when the "
"operating gaps differ sharply across resources, desirable outputs, and "
"pollutants."
msgstr "一家发电厂可能同时使用过多燃料、生产过少电力并排放过多二氧化碳。径向环境模型汇总一套既定联合改进方案，例如让电力增加与排放减少采用同一百分比。这在管理层已经采用相应方案时很有用；当资源、合意产出和污染物之间的经营缺口差异很大时，则提供的信息有限。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:10
#: 74aa2d0fef334b42892e161ab2b18e4b
msgid ""
"Undesirable-output SBM separates these sources of underperformance. It "
"allows fuel excess, missing electricity, and avoidable emissions to differ "
"rather than forcing them into one common percentage, and normalizes each gap"
" by the organization's observed quantity. The result answers a direct "
"management question:"
msgstr ""
"非合意产出 SBM "
"把这些绩效不足来源分开。它允许燃料过量、缺少的电力与可避免排放具有不同幅度，而不强迫它们使用同一百分比，并以组织自身观测数量标准化各项缺口。所得结果回答一个直接管理问题："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:15
#: ecc85f59f37e458692c2980c3eb0efee
msgid ""
"How large are the variable-specific resource, service, and residual gaps in "
"one attainable operating plan, when lower inputs and undesirable outputs and"
" higher desirable outputs are all preferred?"
msgstr "当投入与非合意产出越少越好、合意产出越多越好时，在一个可实现经营方案中，各变量特定的资源、服务和残余物缺口有多大？"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:19
#: 1c8701d77b4e4dad884cb5afb152d7df
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This model extends the slacks-based logic of ordinary SBM {cite:p}`tone2001`"
" to a standard separable undesirable-output account {cite:p}`tone2003bad`. "
"It is a core environmental DEA model, but its apparent simplicity should not"
" hide the production assumption it makes: undesirable outputs can be reduced"
" independently of desirable outputs within the represented technology. That "
"assumption is suitable for some abatement settings and unsuitable for "
"others."
msgstr ""
"该模型把普通 SBM 的松弛逻辑 {cite:p}`tone2001` 扩展到标准可分离非合意产出账户 "
"{cite:p}`tone2003bad`。它是核心环境 DEA "
"模型，但表面简洁不能掩盖其生产假设：在所代表技术中，非合意产出可以独立于合意产出减少。这一假设适合某些治理情形，不适合另一些情形。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:26
#: 735f4a4f32ad4a2cb55e8f3725133ee3
msgid "Three kinds of operating gap, one feasible benchmark"
msgstr "三类经营缺口，一个可行标杆"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:28
#: 3e665e5702b14a5cacb4feb411311180
msgid "For organization $o$, let"
msgstr "对组织 $o$，令"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:30
#: 88b6f704f50c42a6877fdacd494580b5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$x_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^m$ contain inputs;"
msgstr "$x_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^m$ 表示投入；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:31
#: bca15d53f0774ed7920b22756796317b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$y_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^s$ contain desirable outputs; and"
msgstr "$y_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^s$ 表示合意产出；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:32
#: 0a834d2dd3d34686b5997268e2bf3b44
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$b_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^q$ contain undesirable outputs."
msgstr "$b_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^q$ 表示非合意产出。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:34
#: ec4b05cc1a6f4069ae0e643277726af3
msgid ""
"The reference observations are stored in $X$, $Y$, and $B$. A benchmark "
"assembled with nonnegative intensities $\\lambda$ satisfies"
msgstr "参照观测存储在 $X$、$Y$ 和 $B$ 中。用非负强度 $\\lambda$ 构造的标杆满足"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:37
#: fe33c7ac46a44cbba03c38b00c37560d
msgid ""
"\n"
"X\\lambda+s^-=x_o,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"X\\lambda+s^-=x_o,\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:41
#: 37550365637647038e2465f2eb75c296
msgid ""
"\n"
"Y\\lambda-s^+=y_o,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Y\\lambda-s^+=y_o,\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:45
#: 6dfdd04879214eeebcd77d6e4e93c5e1
msgid "and"
msgstr "以及"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:47
#: 2da337f82ebf47f39dfac78c2ec5ed0b
msgid ""
"\n"
"B\\lambda+s^b=b_o,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"B\\lambda+s^b=b_o,\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:51
#: 718dbe8acaa442198fe92adf7a31439f
msgid ""
"where $s^-\\ge0$ is input excess, $s^+\\ge0$ is desirable-output shortfall, "
"and $s^b\\ge0$ is undesirable-output excess."
msgstr "其中，$s^-\\ge0$ 是投入冗余，$s^+\\ge0$ 是合意产出不足，$s^b\\ge0$ 是非合意产出过量。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:54
#: 267ebfad284c46d288812bd45393d09d
msgid "These balances produce an operating target"
msgstr "这些平衡关系给出经营目标"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:56
#: d48b43039df04ead891bf2181533129a
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o-s^-,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat y_o=y_o+s^+,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat b_o=b_o-s^b.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o-s^-,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat y_o=y_o+s^+,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat b_o=b_o-s^b.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:64
#: 80bf861b83b140858edda947f7f32d96
msgid ""
"All three target vectors come from the same reference activity $\\lambda$. "
"The model does not independently choose the most attractive input plan, "
"desirable-output plan, and emissions plan. It searches for one attainable "
"operation that simultaneously uses no more inputs, supplies no less "
"desirable output, and generates no more undesirable output than the "
"evaluated organization."
msgstr ""
"三个目标向量都来自同一个参照活动 "
"$\\lambda$。模型不会分别选择最有吸引力的投入方案、合意产出方案和排放方案，而是寻找一个同时满足投入不更多、合意产出不少于、非合意产出不高于被评价组织的可实现经营方案。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: 1cec8fc22d7348a585a5a3e2f19aa1d3
msgid ""
"An undesirable-output SBM account shows input excess, desirable-output "
"shortfall, and undesirable-output excess as separate normalized operating "
"gaps leading to one feasible benchmark"
msgstr "非合意产出 SBM 账户把投入冗余、合意产出不足和非合意产出过量作为三类独立标准化经营缺口，并形成一个可行标杆"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:75
#: c8d68010b2104753a93f93cd9f674b9e
msgid ""
"The standard undesirable-output SBM does not force every quantity to change "
"by a common percentage. Each resource excess, missing desirable output, and "
"avoidable undesirable output remains visible in its own physical unit. The "
"diagram is schematic: its three rows do not share a physical scale."
msgstr ""
"标准非合意产出 SBM "
"不强制全部数量按同一百分比变化。每项资源冗余、缺少的合意产出和可避免的非合意产出都以自身实际单位保持可见。图只是示意，三行并不共享同一个实际尺度。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:81
#: 9a4058a365404fbca777377ca702981e
msgid ""
"The distinction among variable roles matters. Treating pollution as an "
"ordinary desirable output rewards larger emissions. Treating it as an "
"ordinary input suggests that pollution is chosen before production and "
"substitutes for labor, fuel, or capital. The bad-output balance instead says"
" that the evaluated residual can contain an excess relative to a feasible "
"production plan."
msgstr "变量角色的区别十分重要。把污染作为普通合意产出，会奖励更多排放；把它作为普通投入，则暗示污染在生产前被选择，并与劳动、燃料或资本相互替代。非合意产出平衡式表达的是：相对于一个可行生产方案，被评价残余物可能包含过量。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:87
#: 0cee49c360294955a54d53dd34ce6d5a
msgid "The non-radial environmental ratio"
msgstr "非径向环境比率"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:89
#: ae8540caee7c44fc8cb309f25fc53a1c
msgid "Define the average normalized input excess as"
msgstr "将平均标准化投入冗余定义为"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:91
#: 7029b4bdcbee48b38e917042eefd5562
msgid ""
"\n"
"I_o^x\n"
"=\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\frac{s_{io}^-}{x_{io}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"I_o^x\n"
"=\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\frac{s_{io}^-}{x_{io}}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:96
#: 4ab99df3b765411abf23694ce08c3045
msgid ""
"The retained-resource account is $1-I_o^x$. If $I_o^x=0.20$, the selected "
"benchmark removes an average of 20 percent across the input dimensions. This"
" does not mean that every input falls by 20 percent; one may remain "
"unchanged while another falls much more."
msgstr ""
"保留资源账户为 $1-I_o^x$。若 $I_o^x=0.20$，选定标杆在各投入维度上平均消除 20% 的投入冗余。这不表示每项投入都减少 "
"20%；一项可以保持不变，另一项可以减少更多。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:101
#: d747a42bff1147a19032b862be6df753
msgid ""
"Desirable-output shortfalls and undesirable-output excesses enter one "
"output-side account:"
msgstr "合意产出不足与非合意产出过量共同进入产出侧账户："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:104
#: af7c97c0fb67470d9be54c73cbefacc2
msgid ""
"\n"
"I_o^{yb}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{s+q}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\sum_{r=1}^{s}\\frac{s_{ro}^+}{y_{ro}}\n"
"+\n"
"\\sum_{h=1}^{q}\\frac{s_{ho}^b}{b_{ho}}\n"
"\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"I_o^{yb}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{s+q}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\sum_{r=1}^{s}\\frac{s_{ro}^+}{y_{ro}}\n"
"+\n"
"\\sum_{h=1}^{q}\\frac{s_{ho}^b}{b_{ho}}\n"
"\\right).\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:114
#: fb87466aad10493883e7eeb29bd5719e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An additional desirable service and a reduction in an undesirable residual "
"both count as favorable changes. Their normalized gaps enter symmetrically, "
"one term per declared output dimension. The expansion account is "
"$1+I_o^{yb}$."
msgstr "增加一项合意服务和减少一项非合意残余物都属于有利变化。二者的标准化缺口对称进入账户，每个声明产出维度对应一项。扩张账户为 $1+I_o^{yb}$。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:118
#: 73234d48397f42d4b4eb25f3593d14fd
msgid ""
"It is often clearer in a results table to retain the desirable and "
"undesirable subaccounts separately:"
msgstr "结果表通常把合意与非合意子账户分别保留会更清楚："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:121
#: 878257900091462ba2a16e1f517ce925
msgid ""
"\n"
"I_o^y=\\frac{1}{s}\\sum_{r=1}^{s}\\frac{s_{ro}^+}{y_{ro}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"I_o^b=\\frac{1}{q}\\sum_{h=1}^{q}\\frac{s_{ho}^b}{b_{ho}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"I_o^y=\\frac{1}{s}\\sum_{r=1}^{s}\\frac{s_{ro}^+}{y_{ro}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"I_o^b=\\frac{1}{q}\\sum_{h=1}^{q}\\frac{s_{ho}^b}{b_{ho}}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:127
#: 663a1794a31241178bd6cfb4d2cdabff
msgid "The combined account is a dimension-weighted average,"
msgstr "合并账户是按维度数加权的平均，"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:129
#: 95e632f414d941858f0c234331e180b0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"I_o^{yb}=\\frac{sI_o^y+qI_o^b}{s+q},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"I_o^{yb}=\\frac{sI_o^y+qI_o^b}{s+q},\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:133
#: 15c44fb23362406f8a0d745671dbcba5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"not the unweighted average of the two subaccount means unless $s=q$. DEAPack"
" reports the three means as `desirable_output_inefficiency`, "
"`bad_output_inefficiency`, and `output_inefficiency`; "
"`output_account_factor` is the denominator term $1+I_o^{yb}$."
msgstr ""
"除非 $s=q$，否则它不是两个子账户均值的简单平均。DEAPack 分别以 "
"`desirable_output_inefficiency`、`bad_output_inefficiency` 和 "
"`output_inefficiency` 报告三个均值；`output_account_factor` 是分母项 $1+I_o^{yb}$。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:138
#: f5c60a3115164d23a922e0add8e270b3
msgid "The standard non-oriented undesirable-output SBM score is"
msgstr "标准非导向非合意产出 SBM 得分为"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:140
#: c2cab767b80c4935b0d2b722fbfbe16a
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\rho_o^B\n"
"=\\frac{1-I_o^x}{1+I_o^{yb}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\rho_o^B\n"
"=\\frac{1-I_o^x}{1+I_o^{yb}}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:145
#: 245eb4ddb40448bdb3785b2ca01af70a
msgid ""
"Higher is better. With certified membership in the reference technology and "
"the standard positive data domain,"
msgstr "得分越高越好。在参照技术成员资格得到认证且使用标准正值数据域时，"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:148
#: d6feced0553b4234b1af45a906cd68cf
msgid ""
"\n"
"0<\\rho_o^B\\le1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"0<\\rho_o^B\\le1.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:152
#: 846ed70938b94804b0c1c05a084940f6
msgid ""
"A score of one requires every scored input, desirable-output, and "
"undesirable-output slack to be zero. It therefore certifies strong "
"efficiency under this particular separable technology. A score below one "
"combines resource retention and output-side improvement in a fractional "
"account."
msgstr ""
"得分等于 1 要求所有计分的投入、合意产出和非合意产出松弛量都为零，因此在这一特定可分离技术下认证强有效。得分低于 1 "
"则用一个分式账户综合资源保留与产出侧改进。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:157
#: 012d9a89e5964473a82914c82b7b1a71
msgid ""
"The score is not an emissions-reduction percentage, a cost-benefit ratio, or"
" a measure of social welfare. For example, $\\rho^B=0.60$ does not imply "
"that emissions can fall by 40 percent. The variable-level target and slack "
"tables contain that information. Nor does the equal-dimension average say "
"that a tonne of carbon dioxide causes the same damage as a tonne of another "
"pollutant. The model has normalized technical gaps, not monetized "
"environmental consequences."
msgstr ""
"该得分不是减排百分比、成本收益比或社会福利测度。例如，$\\rho^B=0.60$ 不表示排放可以减少 "
"40%。各变量目标与松弛量表才包含这些信息。等维平均也不表示 1 吨二氧化碳与 1 "
"吨其他污染物造成同等损害。模型标准化的是技术缺口，而没有给环境后果赋予货币价值。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:164
#: e608f9a1b1054c55926b8bd24e47e8ab
msgid "What separability and strong disposability mean"
msgstr "可分离性与强可处置性的含义"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:166
#: dfe97cfd83f547479b58b9070adc5042
msgid "The bad-output equation implies"
msgstr "非合意产出方程意味着"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:168
#: 487de0dac1a64e1c853c8bdbee48812d
msgid ""
"\n"
"B\\lambda\\le b_o.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"B\\lambda\\le b_o.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:172
#: 0a847217504b494297b2359a97a2f7c1
msgid ""
"It permits the comparison plan to generate less undesirable output while "
"maintaining or expanding desirable outputs. In this sense the standard model"
" treats undesirable outputs as separable and strongly disposable. A lower "
"residual can be represented without requiring a proportional reduction in "
"the desirable outputs of the same operation."
msgstr "它允许比较方案在维持或扩张合意产出时生成更少非合意产出。从这个意义上说，标准模型把非合意产出视为可分离且具有强可处置性。较少的残余物可以在不要求同一经营活动的合意产出同比例减少时表示。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:178
#: 8f5588d944ef4483aa2a7e3bff124b76
msgid ""
"This can be credible when the sample contains independently adjustable "
"abatement: better sorting, verified capture, an end-of-pipe treatment unit, "
"improved leakage control, or a production practice that lowers a residual "
"without sacrificing the recorded service. The observed reference activities "
"then provide evidence for the cleaner plan."
msgstr "当样本包含可以独立调整的治理活动时，这一假设可能可信，例如更好的分类、经核实的捕集、末端处理装置、泄漏控制改善，或在不牺牲所记录服务的情况下减少残余物的生产实践。此时，观测参照活动为更清洁方案提供证据。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:184
#: 3fa8e64dad9149bc839911e5e5f132f1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The assumption is not credible merely because lower pollution is preferred. "
"If an undesirable output is an unavoidable joint product and reducing it "
"requires curtailing the associated desirable output, the standard SBM can "
"overstate environmental improvement opportunity. A weak-disposal "
"environmental technology or another explicit joint-production model is then "
"needed {cite:p}`chung1997`. Changing the word `strong` to `weak` while "
"retaining the same balance equations would not change the technology."
msgstr ""
"仅仅因为偏好更少污染，不能证明这一假设可信。如果非合意产出是不可避免的联合产品，减少它必须伴随相关合意产出收缩，标准 SBM "
"就可能夸大环境改进机会。此时需要弱可处置环境技术或其他显式联合生产模型 {cite:p}`chung1997`。保留同样平衡方程而把 `strong` "
"改写为 `weak`，并不会改变技术。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:192
#: 5309ca3be9444d44aa7b7a4dd40dae31
msgid ""
"Null jointness is also not imposed by this model. The estimated technology "
"does not state that zero undesirable output necessarily implies zero "
"desirable output. If the research question requires that physical "
"relationship, it must be represented by an environmental technology designed"
" for joint production."
msgstr "该模型也没有施加零结合性。估计技术没有规定非合意产出为零时合意产出必定为零。若研究问题需要这种物理关系，必须使用为联合生产设计的环境技术表示。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:197
#: 6f224d53d06748069a7358dd0d2c195f
msgid "The decision should be made from engineering and institutional knowledge:"
msgstr "选择应依据工程与制度知识："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: b7f6aad4589d404dbd5cc2b132eedaae
msgid "Operational evidence"
msgstr "经营证据"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: 8fe16aaa3b734e82b3c8ea1a3557efb2
msgid "More defensible starting point"
msgstr "更有根据的起始模型"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: fcdd641ccb8547b69503049e280d99bb
msgid "Pollutants or residuals can be reduced independently within the study horizon"
msgstr "在研究时段内，污染物或残余物可以独立减少"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: 5f841e9a5fcc4499a1f4a62faf37db15
msgid "Standard undesirable-output SBM"
msgstr "标准非合意产出 SBM"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: 9cbb418185964d54b08f9023a3000d78
msgid "Pollution reduction necessarily curtails a jointly produced desirable output"
msgstr "污染削减必然使联合生产的合意产出收缩"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: 9b3e108f1dd3475ab7194fffcef3e5ed
msgid "Weak-disposal environmental DDF"
msgstr "弱可处置环境 DDF"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: e62d575b3b6b4b1baf0f276883953a72
msgid ""
"A regulator has declared one specific combination of output expansion and "
"pollution reduction"
msgstr "监管者已经声明一套特定的产出扩张与污染削减组合"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:70
#: ccf99484f926407fba8484cad2cff539
msgid "Environmental DDF with that direction"
msgstr "采用该方向的环境 DDF"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:205
#: bac60c693ceb4355ae48f3f45e4665ed
msgid ""
"These choices define different estimands. They should not be treated as "
"robustness switches chosen after examining which model gives the preferred "
"ranking."
msgstr "这些选择定义不同估计对象，不能看到哪个模型给出更合意排序后，再把它们当作稳健性开关。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:208
#: 9ae49fe8be664a32a9aaccda8bac0ca1
msgid "Positive normalization is part of the model"
msgstr "正值标准化是模型的一部分"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:210
#: 3542a3d37aa44c8e9efaf586a96e62ce
msgid ""
"Every term in $\\rho_o^B$ divides a slack by the evaluated organization's "
"observed quantity. Inputs, desirable outputs, and undesirable outputs must "
"therefore be finite and strictly positive."
msgstr "$\\rho_o^B$ 的每一项都用松弛量除以被评价组织的观测数量，因此投入、合意产出和非合意产出都必须有限且严格为正。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:214
#: 69770910d1474a6facdbb3ed18aac424
msgid ""
"A genuine zero does not mean “perfect performance” in that dimension. It "
"makes the relative gap undefined. Replacing zero with an arbitrarily small "
"epsilon can give that variable enormous influence and make rankings depend "
"on a number with no economic meaning. Negative quantities are equally "
"outside the standard ratio account. When zeros or signed data are "
"substantively real, the analyst needs a measure whose normalization is "
"defined on that domain."
msgstr ""
"真实零值不表示该维度“绩效完美”，而是使相对缺口未定义。用任意小的 epsilon "
"替换零，可能赋予该变量巨大影响，使排序依赖一个没有经济含义的数值。负数量同样超出标准比率账户。当零或带符号数据具有真实含义时，分析者需要使用在该数据域上定义了标准化的测度。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:221
#: 2c2d804e7f98491a838d3e2bfecfe10b
msgid ""
"The ratio is invariant to coherent positive changes of measurement units. If"
" every carbon-dioxide observation is changed from tonnes to kilograms, both "
"the bad-output slack and its denominator are multiplied by 1,000, leaving "
"their ratio and the score unchanged. The same holds for inputs and desirable"
" outputs."
msgstr ""
"该比率对一致的正计量单位转换保持不变。若把所有二氧化碳观测从吨改为千克，非合意产出松弛量及其分母都乘以 "
"1,000，因此二者之比与得分不变。投入和合意产出同理。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:226
#: 14d75c9c0bcd4535a898b8bc3dca4253
msgid ""
"Translation is different. Adding a constant to every observation changes the"
" denominators without preserving proportional gaps. A shift used merely to "
"eliminate zeros or negative values therefore changes the estimand. Unit "
"invariance should not be confused with translation invariance."
msgstr "平移则不同。给所有观测加同一常数会改变分母，却不能保持比例缺口。仅为消除零值或负值而平移数据会改变估计对象。单位不变性不能与平移不变性混淆。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:231
#: fd07e9656a3c4aeb80d4950e0201dd65
msgid ""
"The equal averages also embed a value judgment. Each input receives weight "
"$1/m$ in the resource account, and every desirable and undesirable output "
"receives weight $1/(s+q)$ in the output-side account. Adding a second "
"measure of the same pollutant can double-count one environmental burden. "
"Combining many pollutants can also reduce the relative influence of each "
"desirable output. Variable selection and aggregation must therefore follow "
"the production question, not data availability alone."
msgstr ""
"等权平均也嵌入价值判断。资源账户中每项投入权重为 $1/m$，产出侧账户中每项合意与非合意产出权重为 "
"$1/(s+q)$。给同一污染物增加第二项测量可能重复计算一种环境负担；合并许多污染物也可能降低每项合意产出的相对影响。因此，变量选择与汇总必须服从生产问题，而不能只看数据是否可得。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:238
#: f76f3af9d9854e579b3f2b23fd8cf337
msgid "Returns to scale and the comparison population"
msgstr "规模报酬与比较总体"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:240
#: 6b84dd6d57d549d29cd46834a16d5703
msgid "Under variable returns to scale, the benchmark intensities satisfy"
msgstr "规模报酬可变下，标杆强度满足"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:242
#: b24d97b7318f4d2cb0aaad41827f5c25
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf1^\\top\\lambda=1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf1^\\top\\lambda=1.\n"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:246
#: cb0d32dac1a74fd787f2f8ad72523948
msgid ""
"The target is a convex combination of represented operations. Under constant"
" returns to scale this restriction is omitted, allowing proportional "
"replication of reference activities. The two technologies can support "
"different slack patterns and scores, so returns to scale must be chosen from"
" the operating context."
msgstr "目标是所代表经营活动的凸组合。规模报酬不变时省略该约束，允许参照活动同比例复制。两个技术可以支持不同松弛模式与得分，因此必须根据经营情境选择规模报酬。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:251
#: 79fb7a77bd7440c3916e66f1c3d71181
msgid ""
"VRS is often a natural starting point when plants, hospitals, or "
"municipalities cannot freely replicate their full operation. CRS can be "
"useful when the production account supports proportional scaling or when the"
" study deliberately combines scale and operating performance. Neither is a "
"numerical repair for an inconvenient result."
msgstr ""
"当工厂、医院或地区不能自由复制完整经营活动时，VRS 往往是自然起点；当生产账户支持同比例缩放，或研究有意综合规模与经营绩效时，CRS "
"可能有用。二者都不是对不方便结果的数值修复。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:256
#: 1ea9e66eb2164b7d9b4eed3576f37cd6
msgid ""
"Reference membership is equally substantive. A contemporaneous comparison "
"asks what the organizations observed in the same period demonstrate. A "
"pooled retrospective comparison may allow later, cleaner practices to "
"benchmark earlier operations. A group restriction can protect mission or "
"regulatory comparability. In every case, the score describes the "
"opportunities admitted by that reference policy."
msgstr "参照成员资格同样具有实质含义。同期比较询问同一时期观测到的组织展示了哪些机会；合并的回溯比较可以让后期更清洁实践评价早期经营活动；群组限制可以保护服务使命或监管可比性。每种情形下，得分都描述相应参照政策允许的机会。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:262
#: 9e4e1b176928441d9bfe071e1acb5510
msgid ""
"For the separable strong-disposal SBM, an analyst can make that "
"comparability rule observation-specific: a plant may be benchmarked only by "
"facilities under the same permit, service obligation, or reporting boundary."
" DEAPack intersects this declared population with the chosen time/reference "
"policy before it solves the SBM account. The restriction changes the "
"evidence available to the plant; it does not change the model's "
"interpretation of independently adjustable desirable service and residual "
"gaps. A careful report therefore gives the eligible population alongside the"
" base and effective reference sizes, rather than calling a restricted score "
"an unconditional environmental ranking."
msgstr ""
"对可分离强可处置 SBM，分析者可以使可比性规则因观测而异：工厂只能由具有同一许可证、服务义务或报告边界的设施评价。DEAPack 在求解 SBM "
"账户前，把声明总体与所选时间/参照政策取交集。限制改变工厂可用的证据，却不改变模型对可独立调整的合意服务与残余物缺口的解释。因此，审慎报告会同时给出合格总体、基础参照规模和有效参照规模，而不会把受限得分称为无条件环境排名。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:272
#: 2f623b1d39814c188073a5aaf7bc3f13
msgid ""
"Self-inclusion normally guarantees that the observed plan is feasible with "
"zero slacks. An external reference set may fail to represent it under the "
"maintained input, desirable-output, and bad-output inequalities. Such "
"infeasibility is evidence about the chosen benchmark; it should not be "
"hidden by changing the disposal assumption after estimation."
msgstr "自包含通常保证观测方案以零松弛量可行。外部参考集可能无法在维持的投入、合意产出和非合意产出不等式下表示它。这种不可行是关于所选标杆的证据，不应在估计后通过改变处置性假设加以掩盖。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:278
#: 8b318d024aa4446e93b5cd8379d1cbbd
msgid ""
"DEAPack records this distinction rather than treating every fit as self-"
"appraisal. For an externally evaluated plant, the fitted SBM balances must "
"establish that its recorded operation belongs to the comparison technology. "
"If they do, the plant can receive an interpretable score even though it was "
"not allowed to benchmark itself. If the external technology cannot represent"
" the operation, no efficiency classification is reported. The package "
"Documentation gives the corresponding diagnostic fields for researchers "
"auditing that distinction."
msgstr ""
"DEAPack 记录这一区别，而不把每次拟合都视为自我评价。对外部评价工厂，拟合的 SBM "
"平衡关系必须证明其记录活动属于比较技术。若成立，即使工厂不允许把自身作为参照，也可以得到可解释得分；若外部技术无法表示该活动，则不报告效率分类。用于审计这一区别的诊断字段见"
" package Documentation。"

