#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:348
#: 98c13a9f6e804d6892fb727a588966bb
msgid ""
"Plant C's environmental SBM improvement account separates resource saving, "
"desirable service gain, and undesirable residual reduction, then reports "
"their observed and target quantities"
msgstr "工厂 C 的环境 SBM 改进账户把资源节约、合意服务增加和非合意残余物减少分开，并报告其观测值与目标值"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:353
#: a26a541b63114c9ba0fc2b8060e9f51f
msgid ""
"Plant C's selected environmental improvement account under the maintained "
"technology. The display keeps the 50 percent resource saving, 100 percent "
"desirable-service gain, and 50 percent undesirable-residual reduction in "
"distinct operational rows. Together they reconstruct $2/7=(1-1/2)/(1+3/4)$. "
"This opportunity is conditional on the separable, strong-disposal "
"technology: the figure neither identifies what caused the gaps, assigns a "
"damage value to the residual, nor says that this is the only feasible "
"improvement plan."
msgstr ""
"工厂 C 在维持技术下选定的环境改进账户。图中把 50% 的资源节约、100% 的合意服务增加和 50% "
"的非合意残余物减少保留在不同经营行中，三者共同重构 "
"$2/7=(1-1/2)/(1+3/4)$。这一机会以可分离强可处置技术为条件；图既不识别缺口成因、不为残余物赋予损害价值，也不表示这是唯一可行改进方案。"

