#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:397
#: 2237c9efb16849e2b84ff0dde374232e
msgid ""
"The low score is not itself a recommendation to cut every variable by $5/7$."
" It is a fractional summary of three different gaps. The target table gives "
"the actionable quantities, while the peer evidence shows that Plant A "
"supports the comparison."
msgstr "低得分本身并不建议把每项变量都削减 $5/7$。它是三个不同缺口的分式汇总。目标表给出可操作数量，参照单元证据则表明工厂 A 支持该比较。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:401
#: 2f50a4413b1c428ab6b3568298f065d7
msgid ""
"The case is intentionally transparent. In a larger dataset, a target can be "
"a convex combination of several plants, and multiple peer combinations can "
"generate the same optimal score. A stable efficiency value does not "
"guarantee a unique operational recipe."
msgstr "该案例有意保持透明。在更大数据集中，目标可能是多家工厂的凸组合，多种参照组合也可能得到同一个最优得分。稳定的效率数值不保证唯一经营方案。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:406
#: 3fb5bdbe048a4a01ba07b21df17a4814
msgid "From score to environmental management evidence"
msgstr "从得分到环境管理证据"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:408
#: 9ed88cf78fe241c6850dd6e97cb75311
msgid ""
"A useful result table begins with the efficiency score but does not end "
"there. It should retain the three component accounts and the important "
"physical targets. For a plant with several fuels, services, and pollutants, "
"management needs to know whether the selected opportunity is concentrated in"
" fuel use, service capacity, carbon dioxide, local air pollution, or several"
" dimensions together."
msgstr "有用的结果表从效率得分开始，却不能止于得分。它应保留三个分量账户与重要实际目标。面对多种燃料、服务和污染物，管理层需要知道选定机会集中在燃料使用、服务能力、二氧化碳、地方空气污染，还是多个维度共同作用。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:414
#: 491ef832505e4f8cb4115478b7bc9d11
msgid ""
"Peers provide comparative evidence, not engineering instructions. A cleaner "
"peer may use different equipment, fuel quality, weather conditions, product "
"mix, or regulatory technology. Before a target becomes an investment or "
"operating plan, specialists must assess whether those omitted differences "
"make the comparison transferable."
msgstr "参照单元提供比较证据，而不是工程说明。更清洁的参照单元可能使用不同设备、燃料质量、天气条件、产品组合或监管技术。在目标成为投资或经营方案前，专业人员必须判断这些遗漏差异是否使比较可迁移。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:419
#: 4d2683da164a4bd99ccb1bfe5f6a6973
msgid ""
"Alternate optima deserve the same caution. The fractional objective can "
"support more than one peer combination or slack allocation with the same "
"score. If a decision depends on one exact emissions target, the analyst "
"should investigate target ranges or apply a justified secondary selection "
"rule rather than treating the first optimal solution as uniquely optimal."
msgstr "替代最优解也需同样谨慎。分式目标可以支持得分相同的多种参照组合或松弛量分配。若决策依赖某个确切排放目标，分析者应研究目标范围或采用有根据的二级选择规则，不能把第一个最优解视为唯一最优。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:425
#: 243c8037860949258816ef3b5e987ae4
msgid "A concise empirical report should state:"
msgstr "简明实证报告应说明："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:427
#: 69134bda7a65472da9decfbd28434481
msgid "which variables are inputs, desirable outputs, and undesirable outputs;"
msgstr "哪些变量属于投入、合意产出和非合意产出；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:428
#: 49af1934284940b1ba30b91d3e877121
msgid ""
"why independent reduction of the undesirable outputs is technologically "
"credible;"
msgstr "为什么在技术上可以独立减少这些非合意产出；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:429
#: a25bb61384584bf3a6bcd2aaa2f70dfd
msgid "the returns-to-scale and reference-population assumptions;"
msgstr "规模报酬和参照总体假设；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:430
#: 1980f171699e44ef98ed479e81f06d05
msgid ""
"the score together with resource, desirable-output, and bad-output gap "
"accounts;"
msgstr "效率得分以及资源、合意产出和非合意产出缺口账户；"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:431
#: c6216dd6f7e54b73a2afc69148a86bde
msgid "key targets in their original units and the peers supporting them; and"
msgstr "原始单位下的关键目标及其参照单元；以及"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:432
#: 94bc9c6b203843a8bc7ec2b8f28d5c0b
msgid "the treatment of infeasible observations, zeros, and alternate optima."
msgstr "如何处理不可行观测、零值和替代最优解。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:434
#: 3e884216195e443db857f084bba9f1e5
msgid "The analysis can support a statement such as:"
msgstr "分析可以支持如下陈述："

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:436
#: 389f5212b7894d8eb490d117bde185c9
msgid ""
"Relative to the VRS comparison technology, Plant C has an undesirable-output"
" SBM score of $2/7$. One optimal plan uses one less resource unit, supplies "
"one additional service unit, and generates one less residual unit."
msgstr ""
"相对于 VRS 比较技术，工厂 C 的非合意产出 SBM 得分为 $2/7$。一个最优方案少用 1 单位资源，多提供 1 单位服务，并少产生 1 "
"单位残余物。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:440
#: f70851ff8b074c5c9140a58ba662232b
msgid ""
"It cannot, without further evidence, establish that management caused the "
"gap, that adopting a peer's practice will cause the predicted improvement, "
"or that the environmental benefit exceeds its implementation cost. It does "
"not attach damage values to pollutants, measure profit, or estimate the "
"effect of regulation."
msgstr "没有进一步证据时，它不能证明管理造成缺口、采用参照单元实践会产生预测改进，也不能证明环境收益超过实施成本。它不为污染物赋予损害价值，不度量利润，也不估计监管效应。"

#: ../../chapters/03-environmental/07-undesirable-output-sbm.md:445
#: ac1fcaa10c4e41098186ef5f8d03e6ef
msgid ""
"The standard undesirable-output SBM is powerful precisely because its claim "
"is focused. It converts a feasible environmental comparison into a "
"transparent account of variable-specific resource excesses, desirable-output"
" shortfalls, and undesirable- output excesses. When its separability and "
"positivity assumptions match the operating system, that account is more "
"informative than a single proportional adjustment. When they do not, a "
"different environmental technology—not a relabeled option—is required."
msgstr ""
"标准非合意产出 SBM "
"的力量正来自其结论边界清晰：它把可行环境比较转化为各变量投入冗余、合意产出不足和非合意产出过量的透明账户。当可分离性与正值假设符合经营系统时，该账户比单一比例调整更有信息；不符合时，需要的是另一种环境技术，而不是更换标签的选项。"

